|description  = {{sbc|Active:}} '''Irelia''' assumes a defensive stance with her blades to {{tip|channel|charge}} for up to {{fd|1.5}} seconds, during which she reduces incoming {{as|physical damage}} by {{pp|40 to 70|key=%}} {{as|(+ 8% per 100 AP)}} and incoming {{as|magic damage}} by {{pp|40*0.5 to 70*0.5|key=%}} {{as|(+ {{ap|8*0.5}}% per 100 AP)}}. Additionally, ''Defiant Dance's'' damage increases over the first {{fd|0.75}} seconds of the channel.
|description2 = ''Defiant Dance'' can be recast within the duration, and does so automatically afterwards. ''Defiant Dance's'' charge cannot be {{tip|interrupt|interrupted}} by {{tip|crowd control}}.
|description3 = {{sbc|Recast:}} '''Irelia''' swipes her blades in the target direction, dealing {{as|physical damage}} to enemies around her and within a line, increased by {{pp|key=%|type=channel time|0 to 200 for 11|0 to 0.75|formula=20% per 0.075 seconds. ''This is capped at 0.75 seconds.''}}. She also retains the damage reduction for {{fd|0.5}} seconds.
